# Full CI/CD Flow — SSOT

## Rule

When aligning dependencies, pushing to main, or resolving merge conflicts, follow the full flow in order:

1. **Version alignment** — `run-version-alignment.sh` (then `--fix` if needed)
2. **Run setup** — `run-all-setup.sh` (updates venvs + uv.lock)
3. **Commit + push** — pyproject.toml, uv.lock, manifest
4. **Sync to main** — `sync-all-to-main.sh` (quickmerge per repo)
5. **If merge conflict** — run `run-all-quality-gates.sh --repo X` on conflicted repos; verify our version passes; resolve manually in Cursor; re-run sync

